      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201300901/2013009010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、夏葉\r\n今日はずいぶん楽しめたみたいだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013009010020,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ええ！　もう、最高よ\r\nとっても楽しかった！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300901/2013009010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013009010030,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "まさかずっと来たかった場所に\r\n撮影で連れて行ってもらえるなんて……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300901/2013009010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今回は『有栖川夏葉の休日』が\r\n特集テーマだったからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "夏葉の休日に行きたい場所が『花鳥園』って\r\nいうのは少し意外だったけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013009010040,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "あら、そうかしら？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300901/2013009010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013009010050,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "鳥も花も好きだもの\r\n……とっても綺麗だった",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300901/2013009010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013009010060,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "素敵な場所だったって\r\nプロデューサーも思わない？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300901/2013009010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、うん\r\nそれはもちろん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "自然がたくさんあって、\r\n癒やされた……って感じかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『休日』にはぴったりの場所だったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013009010070,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "そうでしょう？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300901/2013009010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013009010080,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ふふ、アナタがそう言うなら\r\n企画としてもばっちりね",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300901/2013009010080"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0272",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "id": 2013009010090,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "──これ、今日撮った写真よ\r\n鳥も花もカラフルで……ふふ、可愛い",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300901/2013009010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013009010100,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……どうしたらこんなに綺麗な色に\r\nなれるのかしらね……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300901/2013009010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……でも、今日の風景、\r\nすごく夏葉に似合ってたと思うぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013009010110,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "え……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300901/2013009010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "夏葉はああいう\r\n明るい雰囲気とかさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "自然の中にある\r\n鮮やかな色……みたいなの、よく合ってると思う",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013009010120,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……本当？\r\nすごく嬉しい、ありがとう",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300901/2013009010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013009010130,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "はやくみんなにも写真を見せたいわ……\r\nそうだ、ツイスタにアップしていい？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300901/2013009010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……雑誌が発売されてからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013009010140,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……そうね……！\r\n先に出すわけにはいかないわ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300901/2013009010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、それまでにどの写真を載せるか\r\n選んでおくといいよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺のスマホの方で撮影したのもあるしさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013009010150,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "そうするわ\r\nたくさん撮ってもらったもの",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300901/2013009010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013009010160,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ねえ、アナタが撮ってくれた写真\r\n今見て選んでもいいかしら",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300901/2013009010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？　それは構わないけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "夏葉、明日も仕事だし、\r\n家に着くまで少しでも休んでいたほうが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013009010170,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "いいえ、帰り道は今日を振り返りながら\r\nアナタとおしゃべりするプランよ",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300901/2013009010170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013009010180,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "アナタにだけ運転させるなんてできないし、\r\nそれに……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300901/2013009010180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013009010190,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "家に着くまでが『有栖川夏葉の休日』だもの！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300901/2013009010190"
  },
  {
    "select": "……仕方ないな",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "元気が\r\n有り余ってるな",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "それじゃあ\r\nしりとりだな",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "夏葉はそう言ったら\r\nプランを変えないだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013009010200,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ええ、だって\r\nアナタは付き合ってくれるでしょう？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300901/2013009010200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……まぁ、そうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013009010210,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "私、意外とアナタのこと\r\nよく知っているんだから！",
